{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Then [the angel of YHWH] answered</b> — like וענית ואמרת (\"and you shall answer and say\"), [or like] ויען איוב הראשון (\"and Job the first answered\"). Or the meaning is that he answered to the one who sent him, and this is the correct [interpretation]. And behold, the meaning: with the stirring of wars, then the house of HaShem will be built by the hand of Zerubbabel, as Haggai prophesied, ושמתיך כחותם (\"and I will make you like a signet\")." "<b>These seventy years</b> — I have explained it well in the book of Daniel."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The phrase ושמתיך כחותם quotes Haggai 2:23; included here because Ibn Ezra quotes the Hebrew as part of his intertextual argument."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:29.247501919Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}